.idea

# Finder (MacOS) folder config
.DS_Store
InMobi
backend/clickhouse/.chunks/

# MCP session traces and generated reports. Both are written on every run, so they churn.
# An exhibit worth keeping is copied into pitch/example-report/ and committed there deliberately.
backend/mcp/traces/
backend/mcp/reports/

# Watch subscriptions and the notification log — runtime state, per install.
backend/mcp/watches/

# LibreChat itself is a standard install of the upstream project (see
# frontend/LibreChat/README.md there for setup), not something we authored — vendoring its full
# source (3,700+ files) bloated every diff and PR against this repo. What we actually wrote is the
# wiring: librechat.yaml (custom endpoint + MCP server config) and the .env values, both kept.
frontend/LibreChat/*
!frontend/LibreChat/librechat.yaml
!frontend/LibreChat/.env.example
